<main class="public-page public-page-patient">
    <header class="public-page-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>FOR PATIENTS</div><h1>Your care, easier to follow.</h1><p>Plan appointments, keep track of visits and find the medical history your care team has shared.</p><div class="home-hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary home-primary-action" href="${ctx}/register">Create a patient account <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a><a class="home-login-action" href="${ctx}/login">Already registered? Sign in</a></div></header>
    <section class="public-page-details" aria-labelledby="patient-details-heading"><div class="public-page-section-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>YOUR PATIENT WORKSPACE</div><h2 id="patient-details-heading">Keep every next step close.</h2></div><ol class="home-detail-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Request an appointment</strong><p>Choose a doctor’s published time, add a reason and send a request.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Follow or change your visit</strong><p>Check appointment status, cancel, or choose another available time for a pending or confirmed visit.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Keep your history together</strong><p>Read notes shared by doctors and add personal entries for details you want to remember.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Manage your account</strong><p>Update contact details, change your password and leave feedback after a completed visit.</p></div></li></ol></section>
    <section class="public-info-band"><div class="public-info-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>YOUR SIDE OF THE JOURNEY</div><h2>Know what happens next.</h2></div><div class="public-info-grid"><article><span>01 / REQUEST</span><h3>Ask for a visit</h3><p>Pick an open doctor time and briefly describe the reason for your appointment.</p></article><article><span>02 / CONFIRM</span><h3>Track the status</h3><p>Your request appears in appointment history while the doctor reviews and updates it.</p></article><article><span>03 / FOLLOW UP</span><h3>Keep your information current</h3><p>Shared clinical notes and your own health-history entries are available from Records.</p></article></div></section>
</main>
